  'One complete Planetary Computer published NOAA OISST v2.1 SST COG for 2020-09-01. This L4 analysis blends bias-adjusted satellite, ship and buoy observations and interpolates gaps; it is separate from a raw sensor scene, a current forecast or the original NOAA NetCDF. This finite action leaves the additional-Planetary-collections family Planned.':'一份 Planetary Computer 发布的完整 NOAA OISST v2.1 海温 COG，固定日期 2020-09-01。L4 分析场融合经过偏差订正的卫星、船舶和浮标观测，并插值填补缺口；它不是传感器原场景、当前预报或 NOAA 原 NetCDF。此有限动作开放后，更多 Planetary 集合家族仍待接入。',
  'One reviewed September 2020 h27v05 Terra+Aqua MCD64A1 V061 burned-area Item, with its complete published Burn_Date and separate QA COG assets. This product derives burned-area timing from surface-reflectance change and active-fire information; it is independent of NDVI, reflectance and land-cover classes. The finite COG action leaves the additional-MODIS-products/NASA-HDF family Planned.':'一个已核查的 2020 年 9 月 h27v05 Terra+Aqua MCD64A1 V061 火烧迹地记录，包含发布的完整 Burn_Date 和独立 QA COG。产品根据地表反射率变化及活跃火信息推算火烧日期，与 NDVI、反射率和土地覆盖分类分别发布。此有限 COG 动作开放后，更多 MODIS 产品与 NASA HDF 家族仍待接入。',
  'Original Int16 SST DN are retained. Publisher STAC Celsius scale is exactly 0.009999999776482582 with default offset 0; the original TIFF embeds scale 1 / offset 0, so raw DN and declared physical conversion remain separate. Scalar NoData is -999. Valid zero and negative temperatures are retained. Only 2020-09-01 00:00:00Z–23:59:59Z SST is supported: choosing September does not authorize other days, sea ice, SST anomaly or interpolation-error assets. A spatially filled analysis grid is not a direct observation at every pixel.':'保留 Int16 海温原值。发布方 STAC 摄氏度比例为精确的 0.009999999776482582、默认偏移 0；TIFF 内嵌比例为 1、偏移 0，因此分别保留原值与声明的物理量换算。标量 NoData 为 -999，有效零值和负温度保留。仅支持 2020-09-01 UTC 00:00:00—23:59:59 的海温；选择 9 月不开放其他日期、海冰、海温距平或插值误差资产。完整分析网格不代表每个像元都有直接观测。',
  'Burn_Date is original signed Int16 ordinal day of burn within calendar year 2020: 1–366 denote mapped fire timing, 0 means unburned land, -1 is scalar NoData, and -2 is the separate water code, not scalar NoData. QA is a separate original UInt8 bit field with no embedded scalar NoData; zero remains a stored value. QA bit 0 is land/water, bit 1 data validity, bit 2 shortened mapping period, bit 3 contextual relabeling; bits 5–7 carry special unburned-cell conditions. The original grid uses sphere radius 6371007.181 m, not EPSG:4326. Grayscale of raw day/flag codes is browsing only; no fire severity, emissions, probability, hectares or independently confirmed fire event is inferred. The 2021-11-05 processing time and 2022 Blob modification time do not replace the September 2020 observation interval.':'Burn_Date 保留 2020 年内火烧日的 Int16 原码：1—366 表示映射日期，0 表示未烧陆地，-1 为标量 NoData，-2 为独立水域码，不能当作标量 NoData。QA 为独立 UInt8 原始位域，未内嵌标量 NoData，保留零值。QA 第 0 位为陆地/水域、第 1 位为数据有效性、第 2 位为缩短映射期、第 3 位为上下文重标记；第 5—7 位为未烧像元的特殊条件。原网格使用半径 6371007.181 米的球面，不能标成 EPSG:4326。日期与标记的灰度仅供浏览，不推断火灾强度、排放、概率、公顷面积或独立确认的火灾事件。2021-11-05 处理时间与 2022 年 Blob 修改时间不能替代 2020 年 9 月观测区间。',
