  'The selected WorldCereal theme does not use that published AEZ season':'所选 WorldCereal 主题不对应该地区发布的季节。',
  'The map area does not intersect a reviewed WorldCereal 2021 regional item for this theme/season. Current supported distribution is Mauritius/Réunion (AEZ 9026); no alternate region or season is substituted':'当前地图区域不与该主题 / 季节的 WorldCereal 2021 已核对条目相交。目前支持毛里求斯 / 留尼汪（农业生态区 9026），不会替换为其他地区或季节。',
  'CBERS-4 / 4A · Surface reflectance':'CBERS-4 / 4A · 地表反射率',
