  'Reading more product items…':'正在读取更多产品记录…',
  'Some catalog sources could not be searched':'部分产品目录未能完成检索',
  'No product items match this search.':'没有匹配本次条件的产品记录。',
  'The catalog returns original product items for the selected area and period. Downloads retain each complete selected asset; no clipping, RGB conversion or resampling is applied.':'按当前区域与时间条件检索原始产品记录。下载保留所选文件的完整原件，不进行裁剪、RGB 转换或重采样。',
  'This is the fixed catalog query. Searching archives real item metadata; original files require separate selection, saving and downloading.':'这里显示已确定的目录检索条件。检索会保存真实条目元数据；原始文件需要另行选择、保存和下载。',
  'Catalog completion only describes this metadata search. Item footprints and selected band files do not prove complete, valid-pixel or cloud-free area coverage.':'检索完成仅表示本次元数据查询结束。条目范围和所选波段文件不代表区域已完整覆盖，也不证明像元有效或无云。',
  'The selected reference year downloads one complete published quasi-global model file. The area organizes the project; it does not clip or resample the original.':'所选参考年份对应一份已发布的完整近全球模型文件。当前区域用于组织工程，不会裁剪或重采样原件。',
  'Raster search returned an item from a different query.':'返回的产品记录与本次检索条件不一致。',
  'Raster search returned an item outside the requested area or time.':'返回的产品记录未声明本次所需的区域或时间，或与检索范围不相交。',
