  'HydroSHEDS v2 · Flow direction':'HydroSHEDS v2 · 流向',
  'v2r0 DIR · 1 arc-second · published Americas tiles only':'v2r0 DIR · 1 角秒 · 仅限已发布的美洲分幅',
  'HydroSHEDS v2r0 fixed release':'HydroSHEDS v2r0 固定发行版',
  '100 officially published Americas tiles; unlisted regions are not supported':'官方已发布的 100 个美洲分幅，不支持名单以外的区域',
  'Original numerical GeoTIFF / COG tiles':'原始数值 GeoTIFF / COG 分幅',
  'Only v2r0 DIR flow-direction tiles are supported. This is not a river/basin vector connector or full global coverage.':'仅支持 v2r0 DIR 流向分幅，不提供河流、流域矢量接入，也不代表全球完整覆盖。',
  'The selected month downloads one complete global file covering 60°S to 60°N. The area organizes the project; it does not clip, subset or resample the original.':'所选月份下载覆盖南纬 60° 至北纬 60° 的完整全球文件。区域仅用于组织工程，不裁剪、提取子集或重采样原始文件。',
  'Dataset country code':'数据产品国家代码', 'Dataset search bounds':'数据产品搜索范围',
  'The country code selects the complete published country raster. The area organizes the project; it does not crop the downloaded file.':'国家代码决定完整的已发布国家栅格。区域用于组织工程，下载时不裁剪原始文件。',
  'The area selects intersecting published tiles. Downloads retain each complete file; no clipping or resampling is applied.':'按区域选择相交的已发布分幅。下载保留完整原始文件，不进行裁剪或重采样。',
  'Find published files':'查找发布文件', 'Published sources · {count}':'发布文件 · {count}',
  'These are product file references. File size and actual grid are checked when connecting and inspecting the download.':'这里展示产品文件入口，连接和下载检查会核对文件大小及实际网格。',
  'Product descriptions are GeoD preset declarations based on the publisher documentation. Download inspection reads the actual file; these declarations do not replace that check.':'产品说明来自 GeoD 根据发布方文档整理的预设。下载检查读取实际文件，预设说明不代替文件检查。',
  'Resolved filenames are candidates. Connecting checks public TIFF headers; successful transfer, raw pixel decoding and useful coverage are separate checks. No account, paid service or Earth Engine compute API is used.':'解析得到的文件名只是候选入口。连接时核对公开 TIFF 文件头；完整传输、原始像元解码和有效覆盖需要分别检查。此流程不使用账号、付费服务或 Earth Engine 计算接口。',
  'Dataset preset metadata is a client declaration based on publisher documentation. It does not prove scientific validity, native-file metadata or valid-data coverage. The release/model epoch is not a scene acquisition time.':'产品预设信息是客户端依据发布方文档整理的声明，不代表已验证科学有效性、原始文件信息或有效数据覆盖；发布 / 模型参考时段不等于影像采集时间。',
  'Horizontal CRS from file':'文件中的水平坐标系', 'Vertical CRS from file':'文件中的垂直坐标系',
  'Original GeoTIFF scale and tiepoint tags':'原始 GeoTIFF 缩放与定位标签',
  'These are original file tags, including declared Z components. Map bounds use their horizontal components; raw height samples and the vertical datum are not transformed.':'这里保留原始文件标签，包括声明的 Z 分量。地图范围使用其水平分量，原始高程数值及垂直基准不进行转换。',
  'The source declares a separate vertical CRS. Map bounds and CRS describe the horizontal footprint only; no vertical datum transformation or height calibration is applied.':'文件单独声明了垂直坐标系。地图范围及坐标系仅描述水平覆盖，不转换垂直基准或校准高程。',
  'Original ModelPixelScale/ModelTiepoint Z components are retained in inspection metadata. The footprint uses only their independent horizontal components; original height samples are unchanged.':'检查信息保留原始 ModelPixelScale / ModelTiepoint 的 Z 分量；范围仅使用其独立水平分量，原始高程数值不变。',
  'No published files match this request.':'没有符合当前请求的发布文件。', 'Check source files':'核对来源文件',
  'Review the coverage grid before requesting a service-generated subset.':'先核对覆盖网格，再请求服务生成的子集。',
  'Review coverage subset':'核对覆盖子集', 'Original item properties':'原始条目属性', 'Dataset project name':'数据产品工程名称',
  'Request limits':'请求限制', 'Some source files could not be checked':'部分来源文件未能通过核对',
  'The available files can be selected below. Failed files are excluded; this is not a complete coverage claim.':'下方可以选择核对成功的文件，失败文件不参与选择；这不代表已经完整覆盖目标区域。',
  'Retry source checks':'重新核对来源文件', 'Dataset source check failures are invalid.':'来源文件核对失败的返回信息无效。',
  'Dataset connections do not account for each reviewed source exactly once.':'连接结果未逐一对应核对过的来源文件。',
  'Finding published files…':'正在查找发布文件…', 'Checking published files…':'正在核对发布文件…',
  'Loading dataset metadata…':'正在读取产品信息…',
  'Product connector':'产品接入', 'Published files · verify after download':'发布文件 · 下载后检查',
  'ESA WorldCover · Annual composites':'ESA WorldCover · 年度合成产品',
  'Annual RGB / NIR, SWIR, NDVI and radar composites':'年度 RGB / 近红外、短波红外、NDVI 与雷达合成产品',
