  'Preview display details':'预览显示说明',
  'First-band raw values are stretched to grayscale for display. This is not RGB, a physical-unit conversion, or a classification legend. Embedded TIFF NoData and masks are used; no additional quality mask is applied.':'原始第 1 波段以灰度拉伸预览，不是 RGB、物理单位转换或分类图例。读取 TIFF 内部 NoData 和掩膜，不额外应用质量掩膜。',
  'This original cannot be previewed online. Download it to inspect locally.':'此原件无法在线预览，请下载后在本地查看。',
