  'Loading original raster previews · {count}':'正在加载原始栅格预览 · {count}',
  'Original raster preview unavailable':'原始栅格预览不可用',
  'The original raster preview could not be read. Retry this layer or download the original.':'无法读取原始栅格预览，请重试此图层或下载原件。',
